     desc="Extra Medium is an SEO agency in Nashville: local search, neighborhood pages, technical SEO and AI search visibility for Music City companies.",
     answer="Extra Medium is a marketing agency in Nashville, and our SEO practice is built for how this city actually searches: visitors planning trips down Broadway, newcomers picking neighborhoods, patients choosing providers. We handle technical SEO, local search and content, plus visibility in AI answers. No rented links, no shortcuts.",
     sections=[["A city that gets searched before it gets visited", "<p>For a huge share of Nashville businesses, the sale starts in a search box months before the customer arrives. Visitors research the trip end to end: where to stay, what to hear, where to eat on Broadway and beyond it. Healthcare, one of the largest industries in the city, runs on search too, with patients comparing providers before they ever call. And a fast-growing population means thousands of newcomers searching for every service a household needs, with no habits or loyalties yet. SEO is where all three decisions happen, and it is won or lost long before your door.</p>"], ["Neighborhoods are the keywords", "<p>Nashville does not search as one city. It searches as East Nashville and The Nations, Germantown and Green Hills, 12 South and Bellevue, each with its own intent, price point and vocabulary. We build at that grain: location and neighborhood pages that say something true about each area, Google Business Profiles kept sharp per location, and content that answers the questions each neighborhood actually asks. Layered on top is the newest front: AI search visibility, structuring your facts so AI tools quote your business when people ask them where to go and who to hire. More of our thinking lives on the <a href=\"/answers/\">straight answers</a> hub.</p>"], ["SEO with a senior owner", "<p>SEO fails quietly when nobody senior owns it: a plugin gets installed, a few blogs get posted, and a year later nothing has compounded. Here it sits inside the wider practice of a <a href=\"/marketing-agency-nashville/\">marketing agency in Nashville</a>, so the search strategy answers to the same person who owns positioning and budget. Technical fixes, local presence and content get sequenced against what the business actually needs this quarter, and the reporting shows rankings, calls and revenue, not vanity charts.</p>"]],
     faqs=[["How long does SEO take to work in Nashville?", "Months, and it compounds. Technical fixes and profile work can move local visibility in the first quarter, while competitive terms, the Broadway and healthcare searches especially, take longer. Anyone promising page one in thirty days is selling you something that will not survive the next update."], ["Do you handle SEO for businesses with several Nashville locations?", "Yes. Multi-location is where the neighborhood approach pays off most: a page and a profile per location, each written for its own area instead of copied with the address swapped. A chain searching as one generic brand loses to the competitor who shows up as the local choice in each neighborhood."], ["What is AI search visibility, and does it replace SEO?", "It is the same discipline extended. People now ask AI tools for recommendations directly, and those tools quote businesses whose facts are clear, consistent and well structured. Strong technical and local SEO is the foundation; we build the answer layer on top of it, so you show up in the search results and in the AI's answer."]],
